"\\textbf{Parameters and Variables}, \\  I = \\text{Current function [A]}, "
"\\  \\overline{c}_{\\mathrm{s,n}} = \\text{X-averaged negative particle "
"concentration [mol.m-3]}, \\  D_{\\mathrm{n}} = \\text{Negative particle "
"diffusivity [m2.s-1]}, \\  T_{\\mathrm{amb}} = \\text{Ambient temperature "
"[K]}, \\  c_{\\mathrm{n}}^{\\mathrm{max}} = \\text{Maximum concentration in "
